@startuml F1.14-D03-enviar-documento-estagio
title F1.14-D03 — Enviar documento de estágio
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipsController" as Ctrl
participant "UploadDocumentUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: upload PDF
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /estagios/{id}/documentos\n(multipart)
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE documento\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Aluno: Enviado - aguardando parecer

@enduml
